    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Meanwhile in the underworld, Toshi tries to run a hotel blackmail trap on a sitting politician, lets him bolt out the door, and takes a beating from senior gangster Fujiwara before Furuya quietly hands him pocket money.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あれ？なんかテレビで見たことあるな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "議員の先生じゃねえかよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい、ただで済むと思うなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "しっかり落とし前つけてもらうからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "逃げられましたじゃねえだろ！ガキでもできる仕事をよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "狭い街なんだわ、タレこまれるだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "相手、現職の議員だぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "すいませんでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "お前、親父に苦労かけんなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
