      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huh? I feel like I have seen your face on television.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "議員の先生じゃねえかよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, well—aren't you a member of parliament?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい、ただで済むと思うなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, don't think you are walking away from this for free.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "しっかり落とし前つけてもらうからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are going to settle this score properly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "逃げられましたじゃねえだろ！ガキでもできる仕事をよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't tell me he got away! Even a kid could pull off a job like that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "狭い街なんだわ、タレこまれるだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is a small town—he is going to tip off the cops.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "相手、現職の議員だぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The target was an active lawmaker!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
